							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "1. {{gtClass:name=GtSourceCoderBrowseImplementorsShortcut}} or {{gtClass:name=GtSourceCoderBrowseReferencesShortcut}} fires. Registered via {{gtMethod:name=TElixirNavigationCoder>>initializeNavigationShortcuts:}}, called from each coder's `initializeShortcuts:`."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"createTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-04-29T19:09:45.7253+08:00"
								}
							},
							"editEmail" : {
								"__type" : "email",
								"emailString" : "<unknown>"
							},
							"editTime" : {
								"__type" : "time",
								"time" : {
									"__type" : "dateAndTime",
									"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-04-29T19:09:45.7253+08:00"
								}
							},
							"uid" : {
								"__type" : "uid",
								"uidString" : "sBbZmvgvTxuxNR49LglLiQ=="
							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "2. The shortcut's {{gtMethod:name=GtSourceCoderBrowseImplementorsShortcut>>performOnEditor:element:coder:dueTo:requesterObject:}} calls {{gtMethod:name=TElixirNavigationCoder>>browseImplementorsAt:requesterObject:}} (cursor) or {{gtMethod:name=TElixirNavigationCoder>>browseImplementorsIn:requesterObject:}} (selection). C-n dispatches via the equivalent References pair."
						},
						{
							"__type" : "textSnippet",
							"children" : {
								"__type" : "snippets",
								"items" : [ ]
							},
							"createEmail" : {
