				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## ElixirSearchFilter protocol\n\nSix methods on a {{gtClass:name=GtSearchFilter}} subclass:\n\n- {{gtMethod:name=ElixirSearchFilter>>defaultFilterScope}} — items as async stream.\n- {{gtMethod:name=ElixirSearchFilter>>matches:}} — always true (results are pre-filtered).\n- {{gtMethod:name=ElixirSearchFilter>>gtDisplayOn:}} — title.\n- {{gtMethod:name=ElixirSearchFilter >> =}} + {{gtMethod:name=ElixirSearchFilter >> hash}} — identity for deduplication.\n- {{gtMethod:name=ElixirSearchFilter>>gtItemsFor:}} — overrides to render via streaming coders (see [[Streaming coders pattern]])."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-04-25T14:33:33.188005+08:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-04-25T14:33:33.188005+08:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "VgNXMOvOSMSpVMOedzqJXg=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Why not GtSearchMethodsFilter?\n\n{{gtClass:name=GtSearchMethodsFilter}} is coupled to `CompiledMethod`. Our items are {{gtClass:name=BeamProxyObject}} maps. Its grouping views (`gtItemsByClassFor:`, `gtItemsByPackageFor:`) are Pharo-specific too — we skip them and keep the Results tab."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-04-25T14:33:37.34422+08:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-04-25T14:33:37.34422+08:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "HWd1itB2RHSGk2irdJYfzg=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Qualified vs bare\n\nQualified `Module.function`: {{gtMethod:name=TElixirNavigationCoder>>browseImplementorsAt:requesterObject:}} skips the filter, jumps straight via `Documentation.for_function(...)`.\n\nBare `function`: needs the filter to disambiguate across modules."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-04-25T14:33:38.69247+08:00"
					}
