					"uidString" : "Muci2SpUQ7CRheS0kbJZqw=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Alias resolution\n\nQualified module names go through {{gtMethod:name=TElixirNavigationCoder>>resolveModuleName:}} → `GtBridge.Analysis.resolve_alias` before any BEAM query."
			},
